@distractor-en bill
@distractor-lu Dessert
@distractor-lu Rechnung

@sentence
@lu Hutt Dir scho gewielt?
@en Have you already chosen?
@distractor-en reserved
@distractor-en tasted
@distractor-lu reservéiert
@distractor-lu geschmaacht

@sentence
